@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy - Railcar Trip Management</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto">
            <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
            
            <p class="lead">
                Last updated: <strong>@DateTime.Now.ToString("MMMM dd, yyyy")</strong>
            </p>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Information We Collect</h3>
                    <p>
                        The Railcar Trip Management system processes the following types of information:
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Equipment Data:</strong> Equipment identifiers, event codes, and timestamps</li>
                        <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> City information and time zones for trip processing</li>
                        <li><strong>Trip Records:</strong> Automatically generated trip data including origins, destinations, and durations</li>
                        <li><strong>Import Metadata:</strong> File names, import timestamps, and processing results</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">How We Use Your Information</h3>
                    <p>
                        The information collected is used exclusively for:
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Processing equipment events into trip records</li>
                        <li>Generating reports and analytics on equipment movements</li>
                        <li>Maintaining historical trip data for operational purposes</li>
                        <li>Validating data quality and identifying processing issues</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Data Storage</h3>
                    <p>
                        All data is stored securely in a SQLite database on the application server. 
                        The system implements the following security measures:
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Database access restricted to authorized application services only</li>
                        <li>File upload validation and size restrictions</li>
                        <li>SQL injection protection through Entity Framework Core</li>
                        <li>HTTPS encryption for all client-server communication</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Data Retention</h3>
                    <p>
                        Trip and event data is retained for operational and historical purposes. 
                        Data retention policies should be configured according to your organization's 
                        requirements and applicable regulations.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Cookies and Tracking</h3>
                    <p>
                        This application uses minimal session storage for:
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Maintaining application state during your session</li>
                        <li>Storing user interface preferences (if applicable)</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        We do not use third-party tracking or analytics cookies.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Data Sharing</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        We do not share, sell, or distribute your data to third parties. 
                        All data remains within the confines of this application system and 
                        is accessible only to authorized users within your organization.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Your Rights</h3>
                    <p>
                        You have the right to:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="mb-0">
                        <li>Access your data stored in the system</li>
                        <li>Request corrections to inaccurate data</li>
                        <li>Request deletion of data (subject to operational requirements)</li>
                        <li>Export data in standard formats</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Security Measures</h3>
                    <p>
                        We implement industry-standard security practices:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="mb-0">
                        <li>HTTPS/TLS encryption for all communications</li>
                        <li>Input validation and sanitization</li>
                        <li>Parameterized database queries to prevent SQL injection</li>
                        <li>File upload restrictions and validation</li>
                        <li>CORS policies to prevent unauthorized access</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Changes to This Policy</h3>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        This privacy policy may be updated periodically to reflect changes in 
                        functionality or legal requirements. The "Last updated" date at the top 
                        of this page indicates when the policy was last revised.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="alert alert-warning">
                <h5 class="alert-heading">
                    <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill me-2"></i>Development Version Notice
                </h5>
                <p class="mb-0">
                    This is a development/assessment version of the application. For production use, 
                    additional security measures, authentication, and compliance features should be 
                    implemented according to your organization's requirements and applicable regulations 
                    (GDPR, CCPA, etc.).
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card border-primary">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">Contact Information</h5>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        For questions about this privacy policy or how your data is handled, 
                        please contact your system administrator or data protection officer.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
